sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as User Interface
    participant VM as ViewModel
    participant Repo as Repository
    participant DB as Database
    participant API as Open-Meteo API

    UI->>VM: Request current weather and forecast
    VM->>Repo: Load weather data
    Repo->>DB: Check stored weather and forecast

    alt Stored data is available
        DB-->>Repo: Return current weather and forecast
    else Data must be refreshed
        Repo->>API: Request current weather and 7-day forecast
        API-->>Repo: Return weather and forecast
        Repo->>DB: Store updated weather data
    end

    Repo-->>VM: Return weather and forecast
    VM-->>UI: Display current weather and forecast